### ===================================================================
### SUBLIMATIO - REST CLIENT API SPECIFICATION & TEST COLLECTION
### Host: http://localhost:3000
### Resource: /payloads (Volatile Ephemeral Buffer)
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@payloadId = sub-f-01

### 1. GET ALL PAYLOADS (findAll)
### Mengambil seluruh daftar payload yang tersimpan di buffer RAM
GET {{baseUrl}}/payloads
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. GET SINGLE PAYLOAD BY ID (findOne) - SUKSES
### Mengambil detail satu payload berdasarkan ID uniknya
GET {{baseUrl}}/payloads/{{payloadId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. GET SINGLE PAYLOAD BY ID - ERROR 404 (NotFoundException)
### Menguji penanganan exception saat data payload tidak ditemukan di buffer
GET {{baseUrl}}/payloads/sub-id-tidak-ada
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. POST CREATE NEW PAYLOAD (create) - SUKSES (201 Created)
### Menambahkan data payload teks baru ke buffer RAM
POST {{baseUrl}}/payloads
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "production-jwt-mesh-secret.key",
  "type": "text",
  "content": "MESH_TOKEN_NONCE=8f92ab1c90f23b7;KEY_ROTATION=300s",
  "device": "Desktop (Workstation-X)",
  "totalTTL": 300,
  "isPinned": false
}

###

### 5. POST CREATE - ERROR 400 (ValidationPipe class-validator)
### Menguji validasi DTO: name < 3 karakter, tipe data tidak valid, totalTTL negatif
POST {{baseUrl}}/payloads
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "a",
  "type": "invalid_type",
  "totalTTL": -50
}

###

### 6. POST CREATE - ERROR 409 (ConflictException)
### Menguji penanganan exception saat nama payload duplikat sudah ada di RAM
POST {{baseUrl}}/payloads
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Staging Database Connection URL",
  "type": "text",
  "content": "DUPLICATE_PAYLOAD_TEST",
  "totalTTL": 120
}

###

### 7. PATCH UPDATE PAYLOAD (update) - SUKSES (200 OK)
### Memperbarui sebagian field payload (nama, remainingTTL, isPinned)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/payloads/{{payloadId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "session-auth-token-renewed.pem",
  "remainingTTL": 90,
  "isPinned": true
}

###

### 8. PATCH UPDATE PAYLOAD - ERROR 404 (NotFoundException)
### Menguji exception jika mencoba memperbarui ID yang tidak ada
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/payloads/sub-id-palsu
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Payload",
  "remainingTTL": 60
}

###

### 9. DELETE REMOVE PAYLOAD (remove) - SUKSES (200 OK)
### Menyublimasikan (menghapus permanen) payload dari RAM
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/payloads/sub-f-03
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. DELETE REMOVE PAYLOAD - ERROR 404 (NotFoundException)
### Menguji exception jika menghapus payload yang sudah terhapus / tidak ada
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/payloads/sub-f-03
Accept: application/json
